    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "The preparations for the ritual are almost complete."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I... I'm not sure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I... I don't feel so good today..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Mamma..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Mister Friar, I was really happy yesterday..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Rosella told me about lots of fun stuff... We prepared for the funeral together, and it felt like... I was doing something for Mamma."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "But... we're done with everything now... What comes next?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I think... I worked really hard... for Mamma..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "But... can Mamma see all that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Does all of this... really mean something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Mister Friar, have you gone through this a lot?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "When it happens... during... the funeral... what... what should I do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "And what do I do... once it's over?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Hm. Right, the funeral..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "You're still young, but I don't want to hide anything from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We do a lot of things for others, but, in the end, we do it for ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Cecelia, this isn't selfishness. Rather, it just means that, ultimately, everything that the living do is to mold and shape themselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We hold funerals and say our goodbyes when our loved ones leave us, but it's also a respite for ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "It's a way to mark the road that we've trodden."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Many grown-ups... use this as a way to find peace, but whether they truly find it, or indeed anything, isn't the fault of the funeral itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "It's really up to us, after we go through the thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Once we are done looking back and resting, we must keep going forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "But where do we go after that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "That is something you need to ask yourself, Cecelia."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "This is a question that only you can answer yourself, and it's a question that both you, I, and everyone must answer in our lifetimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Ask myself..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Only you can find the right way forward for yourself, and it is only with your own two legs that you can walk that path."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "What about you, Mister Friar? You know so much... What is your road like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "I can't answer you that. I'm afraid I can't even say I've found it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "It's a tough search, and a sad journey. It makes you wonder if the way forward ever truly exists."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "But I haven't given up, and that is why I, and my brothers and sisters, call ourselves..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "...'the Pathfinders.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
